    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41186" root="هزلج" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِزْلَاجٌ</span></b>  <i>Quick,</i> or <i>swift:</i> (TA:) a <i>light,</i> or an
<i>agile,</i> (<i>and swift,</i> or <i>quick,</i> TA,) wolf: (S, K:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزَالِجُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزَالِيجُ</span>. (TA.) Accord. to Kr,
it is derived from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الهَزَجُ</span>. (TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هزْمَجَةٌ</span> in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هزج</span>.]

